-- Accidents. The standard accident: the car was moving under its driver's control in road traffic on 2024-06-15,
-- inside the term of the 2024 contract; nothing in Article 7(2) applies; the owner had not handed the car to another.
`the standard accident` MEANS `An accident` WITH
    `date of the accident` IS YMD 2024 6 15
    `the vehicle was participating in road traffic` IS TRUE
    `the vehicle was moving, stopped or parked` IS TRUE
    `the vehicle was under the control of its owner or a driver` IS TRUE
    `the owner had handed possession and use of the vehicle to another` IS FALSE
    `the owner or the driver acted intentionally to cause the damage` IS FALSE
    `the driver who caused it deliberately fled` IS FALSE
    `the driver who fled had performed the owner's civil liability` IS FALSE
    `the driver did not meet the age condition of the Road Traffic Law` IS FALSE
    `the driver had no driving licence` IS FALSE
    `the driver used an invalid driving licence` IS FALSE
    `the driver's licence was erased or altered` IS FALSE
    `the driver's licence had expired at the time of the accident` IS FALSE
    `the driver used a licence not matching the vehicle` IS FALSE
    `the driver's right to use the licence was suspended for a term, or the licence was revoked` IS FALSE
    `the driver's blood or breath alcohol exceeded the normal level in the Ministry of Health guidance` IS FALSE
    `the driver had alcohol in the blood or breath, at any level` IS FALSE
    `the driver had used drugs or banned stimulants` IS FALSE
    `caused by war, terrorism or an earthquake` IS FALSE
    `an authority found it caused entirely by the fault of a third party` IS FALSE
    `several motor vehicles caused it` IS FALSE
    `the owner's share of the fault` IS 1
    `the persons harmed` IS EMPTY

